{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_520FFE5C","title":"Marcelle's Memories","entry":"Dlg_520FFE5C::entry","exit":"Dlg_520FFE5C::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_3A7BBB7F","articyId":"72057611217950983","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marcelle DeNuite","text":"Did you know, I had the privilege of eating one of the last true cherries to grow on a tree? In a tart made from reconstituted ash-flour pastry.","speakerId":"Ntt_F55BAE21","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Did you know, I had the privilege of eating one of the last true cherries to grow on a tree? In a tart made from reconstituted ash-flour pastry.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":450.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47791","byteOffset":32414608,"byteLength":452}},{"id":"DFr_69F9ADC5","articyId":"72057611217951004","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marcelle DeNuite","text":"Bitter and sour, like rain without the water. A space at its heart where a stone should be.","speakerId":"Ntt_F55BAE21","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Bitter and sour, like rain without the water. A space at its heart where a stone should be.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":1075.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"16946","byteOffset":14301688,"byteLength":436}},{"id":"DFr_C79634D6","articyId":"72057611217951011","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marcelle DeNuite","text":"I've been thinking about how, when we eat, we become time travellers. Slurping down the past, savoring our present and maybe, even, tasting the future.","speakerId":"Ntt_F55BAE21","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I've been thinking about how, when we eat, we become time travellers. Slurping down the past, savoring our present and maybe, even, tasting the future.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1725.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24749","byteOffset":17242648,"byteLength":496}},{"id":"DFr_A71F5F9D","articyId":"72057611217951040","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marcelle DeNuite","text":"That you might be in more danger than you know.","speakerId":"Ntt_F55BAE21","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"That you might be in more danger than you know.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2299.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"34294","byteOffset":20858296,"byteLength":356}},{"id":"DFr_1EB1DA73","articyId":"72057611217951054","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marcelle DeNuite","text":"Nothing. Too many words on an empty belly, that’s all.","speakerId":"Ntt_F55BAE21","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Nothing. Too many words on an empty belly, that’s all.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2900.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47549","byteOffset":32325752,"byteLength":400}},{"id":"DFr_0B01DFE8","articyId":"72057611217951088","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marcelle DeNuite","text":"If you wish to stand out in Nivalis, you will have to be... adventurous when it comes to ingredients. Do not be afraid to try something new.","speakerId":"Ntt_F55BAE21","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"If you wish to stand out in Nivalis, you will have to be... adventurous when it comes to ingredients. Do not be afraid to try something new.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5175.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41210","byteOffset":29917920,"byteLength":448}},{"id":"DFr_E5645422","articyId":"72057611217951095","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marcelle DeNuite","text":"For you? I think not.","speakerId":"Ntt_F55BAE21","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"For you? I think not.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":5175.0,"y":675.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48225","byteOffset":32580696,"byteLength":332}},{"id":"DFr_DBEC6981","articyId":"72057611217951102","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marcelle DeNuite","text":"You’re too kind. But I heard that Mr Danetti is debuting a new donut. Maybe this time he’s got it right.","speakerId":"Ntt_F55BAE21","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You’re too kind. But I heard that Mr Danetti is debuting a new donut. Maybe this time he’s got it right.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":3825.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20063","byteOffset":15475400,"byteLength":452}},{"id":"DFr_36AEB5C4","articyId":"72057611217951116","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marcelle DeNuite","text":"A last word before I go?","speakerId":"Ntt_F55BAE21","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"A last word before I go?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4425.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"52622","byteOffset":34321632,"byteLength":3